---

<Base title="Vault">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Vault</h1>
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        "He that has eyes to see and ears to hear may convince himself that no mortal can keep a secret. If his lips are
        silent, he chatters with his fingertips; betrayal oozes out of him at every pore." — Sigmund Freud
      </p>
    </blockquote>
    <p>This section contains a hidden gem. To access it, answer this riddle:</p>
    <p class="riddle">
      <strong>
        What are you if your curved shape manipulates airflow to create a pressure difference and generate lift, all while
        remaining an essential component of wings and propellers?
      </strong>
    </p>
    <p>Enter the answer in British English, followed by the year 2025. For eg: <strong><i>screw2025</i></strong></p>
    <RiddleLock iv="d004bafe4caeb3b8227d3bd7" cipher="" />
    <p class="muted small">Credits: <a href="https://khushimittal.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Khushi Mittal's Vault</a></p>
  </div>
